#. column 2: Owing to myriad contributions by artisans like you, we have achieved every last objective outlined for Phaenna. Enjoy a well-earned rest, and stay alert for future updates!
#. column 3: Our work on Phaenna may be complete, but our dreams shine ever brighter. Enjoy your time on this planet of glass as we prepare for future liftoff!
#. column 4: Searchingway
msgctxt "WKSDevGrade:131:0:1"
msgid "Phaenna Development Initiative Complete"
msgstr "Программа освоения Фаэнны завершена"

#. ja: 協力してくれたみんなのおかげで、惑星パエンナの全施設が完成したッス！<br>次に旅立つ星を探してるッス、これまでのご協力ありがとうッスよー！！
#. de: Alle Stationsstrukturen hier auf Phaenna konnten fertig gestellt werden! Ich fiebere mit Aufregung dem Tag entgegen, an dem wir zu unserem nächsten Ziel aufbrechen werden!
#. fr: Toutes les infrastructures de la station Souffleverre sont achevées<nbsp>! Maintenant, la prochaine planète nous attend<nbsp>! Fé<shy>li<shy>ci<shy>ta<shy>tions et merci à toutes et à tous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Phaenna Development Initiative Complete<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Prepare for future exploration.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 1: Phaenna Development Initiative Complete
#. column 3: Our work on Phaenna may be complete, but our dreams shine ever brighter. Enjoy your time on this planet of glass as we prepare for future liftoff!
#. column 4: Searchingway
msgctxt "WKSDevGrade:131:0:2"
msgid "Owing to myriad contributions by artisans like you, we have achieved every last objective outlined for Phaenna. Enjoy a well-earned rest, and stay alert for future updates!"
msgstr "Благодаря труду таких мастеров, как вы, мы выполнили все задачи на Фаэнне. Вы заслужили отдых. Следите за новостями — впереди новые проекты!"

#. ja: 協力してくれたみんなのおかげで、惑星パエンナの全施設が完成したッス！　ありがとうッスよー！！
#. de: Alle Stationsstrukturen hier auf Phaenna konnten fertig gestellt werden! Danke an alle Projektteilnehmer!
#. fr: Grâce à nos efforts combinés, les différentes infrastructures prévues pour <br>la station Souffleverre sont enfin terminées ! Merci, merci, et encore merci !!!
#. column 0: Phaenna Development Initiative Complete<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Prepare for future exploration.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
