msgstr "Подготовка к расширению ангара мехов<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Выполняйте космические миссии.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 「ハンガー拡張計画」　資材集積中
#. de: Sternenhangar: Renovierung - In Planung
#. fr: Amélioration des hangars<nbsp>: collecte des matériaux
#. column 0: Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Complete stellar missions.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 2: Myriad mysteries await in the Core Shroud, but to access the tip of the tower, we'll need vacuum suits─and an enhanced hangar to house them!
#. column 3: If our mech hangar suddenly achieved sentience, it would be crying out for improvements! Let's make sure those hypothetical cries don't go unanswered.
#. column 4: Searchingway
msgctxt "WKSDevGrade:239:0:1"
msgid "Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion"
msgstr "Подготовка к расширению ангара мехов"

#. ja: 北東部のコア・シュラウドは、惑星ネットワークの中枢らしいッス！<br>パワーローダーでタワー上層へ昇るための方法が検討されてるッスよ！
#. de: Wir wollen den Sternenhangar im Hinblick auf die Weiterentwicklung unserer Mechas überarbeiten. Nur so können wir den riesigen Turm im Kernmantelwald erreichen. Jede Stellarmission hilft!
#. fr: Les mécanos cosmiques sont le meilleur moyen d'accéder à l'Écosystème central. De nouveaux modèles vont être déployés, mais pour cela, nous devons d'abord moderniser nos hangars<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Complete stellar missions.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 1: Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion
#. column 3: If our mech hangar suddenly achieved sentience, it would be crying out for improvements! Let's make sure those hypothetical cries don't go unanswered.
#. column 4: Searchingway
msgctxt "WKSDevGrade:239:0:2"
msgid "Myriad mysteries await in the Core Shroud, but to access the tip of the tower, we'll need vacuum suits─and an enhanced hangar to house them!"
msgstr "В Сердце чащи скрыто множество тайн, но чтобы добраться до вершины башни, нам понадобятся скафандры и расширенный ангар для них!"

#. ja: ローダーハンガーを改築するッス！　一緒に資材を集めてほしいッスよー！
#. de: Wir wollen den Sternenhangar renovieren. Gerade werden noch Materialien gesammelt, wobei wir für jede Unterstützung dankbar sind!
#. fr: Nous projetons d'améliorer les hangars des machines !<br>Aidez-nous à réunir les matériaux nécessaires<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion<br><ui-color 571><ui-edge-color 572>Complete stellar missions.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 1: Preparation for Mech Hangar Expansion
#. column 2: Myriad mysteries await in the Core Shroud, but to access the tip of the tower, we'll need vacuum suits─and an enhanced hangar to house them!
#. column 4: Searchingway
msgctxt "WKSDevGrade:239:0:3"
msgid "If our mech hangar suddenly achieved sentience, it would be crying out for improvements! Let's make sure those hypothetical cries don't go unanswered."
msgstr "Если бы ангар мехов вдруг ожил, он бы умолял о ремонте! Не будем же оставлять его без внимания — помогите собрать материалы."

#. ja: サーチングウェイ
#. de: Searchingway
#. fr: Searchingway
